msgid "Read one paragraph aloud three times against the timer. Same words, rising speed — the measured words-per-minute curve is the clearest evidence that fluency comes from repetition, not talent. Paragraphs carrying your due words can be recommended."
msgstr "掐着表把同一段落朗读三遍。同样的词、越来越快的速度——实测的每分钟词数曲线最能说明流利度来自重复而非天赋。也可以让系统推荐含你到期词的段落。"

