msgid "No exports yet."
msgstr "还没有导出记录。"

msgid "Download ZIP"
msgstr "下载 ZIP"

msgid "Password must be at least 6 characters."
msgstr "密码至少需要 6 个字符。"

msgid "The two passwords do not match."
msgstr "两次输入的密码不一致。"

msgid "Creating export…"
msgstr "正在创建导出…"

msgid "Export started. It usually takes less than a minute."
msgstr "导出已开始，通常不到一分钟完成。"

msgid "Failed to create export"
msgstr "创建导出失败"

msgid "Export My Learning Data"
msgstr "导出我的学习数据"

msgid "Download your vocabulary and practice records as an encrypted ZIP: Anki-importable word cards, machine-readable JSON/CSV and a readable review report. Audio is not included."
msgstr "把你的词汇与练习记录打包成加密 ZIP 下载：内含可导入 Anki 的单词卡、机器可读的 JSON/CSV 和一份可读的回顾报告。不包含音频。"

msgid "ZIP password"
msgstr "ZIP 解压密码"

msgid "At least 6 characters"
msgstr "至少 6 个字符"

msgid "Repeat password"
msgstr "再次输入密码"

msgid "The password is used only to encrypt the file. It is never stored — if you forget it, export again."
msgstr "密码只用于加密文件，系统不会保存；忘记密码只能重新导出。"

msgid "Create export"
msgstr "生成导出"

msgid "Not encrypted"
msgstr "未加密"

msgid "Leave the password empty to get an unencrypted ZIP — anyone who gets the file can open it. The password is never stored; if you forget it, export again."
msgstr "不设密码则导出不加密的 ZIP——任何拿到文件的人都能打开。密码只用于加密文件、系统不保存；忘记密码只能重新导出。"
